## Model card

- **Name:** LongCat 2.5 Preview
- **Short description:** Meituan's API-only hosted preview (released 2026-09-25) of its next LongCat generation — a natively multimodal MoE (1.6T total / ~48B active) with a 1M-token context, positioned for long-horizon coding/agent work across terminals, browsers, GUIs, spreadsheets and design tools. Not the open-weight LongCat 2.0.
- **Provider / access:** Hosted API on the LongCat platform (`meituan/longcat-2.5-preview`), OpenCode Zen free slot `longcat-2.5-preview-free`, Blackbox AI `blackboxai/meituan/longcat-2.5-preview`, Nous Portal `meituan/longcat-2.5-preview:free`. OpenAI-compatible Chat Completions. Closed weights.
- **Release / knowledge:** Released 2026-09-25; knowledge cutoff not published.
- **IDs:** `meituan/longcat-2.5-preview`; Zen free slot `longcat-2.5-preview-free`.
- **Context window:** 1,048,576 (1M); 131,072 max output (OpenCode Data model facts, Blackbox spec sheet).
- **Modalities:** text, image in; text out. Reasoning and tool calling supported.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-21):** $0.30 in / $1.20 out per 1M, $0.006 cached read (limited-time price); free at OpenCode Zen and Nous Portal while the slots last.
- **Architecture:** natively multimodal mixture-of-experts, 1.6T total / ~48B active (BenchmarkList / explainx positioning); closed weights, no model card.

